OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA mostly dry
OL,6,Fnight with plenty of cloud and the odd
OL,7,Fshower. Clear spells in northern and
OL,8,Fwestern areas could allow patches of
OL,9,Ffog and frost to form. Staying breezy
OL,10,Ffurther south.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FA cold but bright start in
OL,13,Fthe north and west, otherwise a mix of
OL,14,Fcloud and some bright spells. A few
OL,15,Fshowers developing, especially in the
OL,16,Feast. Temperatures near average.
